Package: mwtab2mztabm
Title: Convert Metabolomics Workbench mwTab Files to mzTab-M
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Kozo", "Nishida", email = "kozo.nishida@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Downloads mwTab JSON files from the Metabolomics Workbench,
    exports their sample metadata to a TOML file and their metabolite-wise
    quantification table to a Parquet file, and assembles both into an
    mzTab-M 2.1 file. The mzTab-M metadata (MTD) section is built from the
    TOML file and the small molecule (SML) section from the Parquet file using
    the RmzTabM reference implementation.
License: Artistic-2.0
URL: https://github.com/integMET/mwtab2mztabm
BugReports: https://github.com/integMET/mwtab2mztabm/issues
Depends:
    R (>= 4.6)
Imports:
    jsonlite,
    nanoparquet (>= 0.3.0),
    RcppTOML,
    RmzTabM,
    stats,
    utils
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Remotes:
    rformassspectrometry/RmzTabM
biocViews: MassSpectrometry, Metabolomics, DataImport
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.1
